Show the save slot and save/load results on screen.

PgUp/PgDn (and +/-) changed the save slot silently, and S and L gave no
feedback either: the slot number, a refused save or a missing slot were
only printed to the terminal, so it was easy to save over the wrong slot.
Show a short message in the top right corner for 2.5 seconds: "Slot 3"
(or "Slot 3 (empty)"), "Saved to slot 3", "Loaded slot 3", "Slot 3 is
empty", "Not saved: game over" or "Could not save to slot 3".

